    "text": "$|z+1-i|^2+|z-5-i|^2=(x+1)^2+(y-1)^2+(x-5)^2+(y-1)^2$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& =2\\left(x^2+y^2-4 x-2 y\\right)+28 \\\\\n& =2(4)+28 \\\\\n& {\\left[\\because x^2+y^2-4 x-2 y=4\\right]} \\\\\n& =36 \\\\\n&\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
